Rule 3.5 mm: V1.2 caps  PASS (3.61 mm, +-0.25 mm placement, ASSUMPTION cap length); +-0.5 mm 3.13 mm FAIL
Rule 3.5 mm: 2512 B min 4.4 mm PASS; 2010 B min 3.0 mm FAIL; 1206 B min 1.7 mm FAIL; MELF 0207 L1 min 3.2 mm FAIL
Rule 3.5 mm, 2x series: per-gap requirement at 4 kV (V/2) is below 3.2 and 4.4 mm -> PASS for both (see table)

